@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}

<div class="container mt-4 mb-4">
    <h1>@ViewData["Title"]</h1>
    <p>
        At <strong>Grand Horizon Hotel</strong>, we are committed to protecting the privacy
        and personal information of our guests and website users.
        This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, store, and protect your data
        when using our reservation and guest management system.
    </p>

    <h3>1. Information We Collect</h3>
    <p>We may collect the following types of personal information:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>Full name</li>
        <li>Email address</li>
        <li>Phone number</li>
        <li>Reservation details (check-in/check-out dates, room preferences)</li>
        <li>Guest identification details where required</li>
        <li>Login credentials for authenticated users</li>
        <li>Usage data such as login activity and system interactions</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>2. How We Use Your Information</h3>
    <p>Your information is used for the following purposes:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>Managing hotel reservations</li>
        <li>Registering and managing guest records</li>
        <li>Processing check-ins and check-outs</li>
        <li>Improving hotel services and website functionality</li>
        <li>Maintaining security and preventing unauthorized access</li>
        <li>Communicating reservation updates or important notices</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>3. Data Security</h3>
    <p>
        We implement appropriate technical and organizational measures to protect
        your personal data from unauthorized access, alteration, disclosure, or destruction.
        Access to sensitive guest information is restricted to authorized personnel only.
    </p>

    <h3>4. Data Retention</h3>
    <p>
        Guest and reservation data is retained only for as long as necessary
        to fulfill operational, legal, and administrative purposes.
    </p>

    <h3>5. Sharing of Information</h3>
    <p>
        We do not sell, trade, or rent your personal information to third parties.
        Information may only be shared when required by law or for legal compliance.
    </p>

    <h3>6. Cookies and Authentication</h3>
    <p>
        This website may use cookies and authentication sessions to maintain secure login access
        and improve user experience.
    </p>

    <h3>7. Your Rights</h3>
    <p>
        You may request access to, correction of, or deletion of your personal data
        by contacting the hotel administration.
    </p>

    <h3>8. Contact Us</h3>
    <p>
        If you have any questions regarding this Privacy Policy,
        please contact <strong>Grand Horizon Hotel Administration</strong>.
    </p>
</div>